/P 326 0 R
/T (Another key challenge is the inability of current systems to detect and classify different types of obstacles and environmental features, such as pedestrian crosswalks or currency notes, which are essential for independent daily activities. Many existing solutions also fail to provide directional guidance, making it difficult for users to make informed navigation decisions.)
/E (Another key challenge is the inability of current systems to detect and classify different types of obstacles and environmental features, such as pedestrian crosswalks or currency notes, which are essential for independent daily activities. Many existing solutions also fail to provide directional guidance, making it difficult for users to make informed navigation decisions.)
