/T (Simultaneously, the mobile application monitors additional conditions such as fall detection and user-triggered alerts. If a fall or emergency is detected, the system automatically sends notifications to predefined contacts. Other features such as weather updates, time announcements, and reminders operate based on user requests or predefined triggers.)
/E (Simultaneously, the mobile application monitors additional conditions such as fall detection and user-triggered alerts. If a fall or emergency is detected, the system automatically sends notifications to predefined contacts. Other features such as weather updates, time announcements, and reminders operate based on user requests or predefined triggers.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [8]
>>
