/S /H2
/P 339 0 R
/T (The database is designed to be simple, scalable, and efficient, allowing easy integration of additional features in the future. Mechanisms such as referential integrity are used to maintain consistency when records are updated or deleted. Overall, the database structure ensures reliable data management and supports the smooth functioning of the B.E.A.C.O.N system.)
/E (The database is designed to be simple, scalable, and efficient, allowing easy integration of additional features in the future. Mechanisms such as referential integrity are used to maintain consistency when records are updated or deleted. Overall, the database structure ensures reliable data management and supports the smooth functioning of the B.E.A.C.O.N system.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [13]
>>
