1394 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 344 0 R
/E (Functional testing is performed to verify that all system features operate according to the specified requirements. Key functionalities such as real-time obstacle detection, navigation guidance, currency recognition, fall detection, and emergency alert triggering are tested under various scenarios. The system is evaluated to ensure that it provides accurate outputs and appropriate responses for different inputs. This testing confirms that the system meets its intended objectives.)
/Pg 59 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
