/Title (This research aims to improve real-time safety helmet detection in complex construction environments where challenges such as small object size, cluttered backgrounds, and varying lighting conditions exist. The study focuses on enhancing the detection accuracy of helmets using an improved YOLOv8 model. The ultimate goal is to ensure worker safety by enabling reliable and fast identification of helmet usage, thereby reducing workplace accidents and enforcing safety compliance effectively.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4376 0 R
>>
