4796 0 obj
<<
/Title (In addition, reliance on cloud-based processing in some modern systems results in increased latency and dependency on internet connectivity, making them unreliable in outdoor or low-network environments. Privacy concerns further arise when user data is transmitted to external servers. The lack of accessible and intuitive user interfaces also poses a challenge, as visually impaired users require systems that provide clear and simple interaction mechanisms.)
/Dest [42 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4754 0 R
/Prev 4795 0 R
/Next 4779 0 R
>>
